      "title": "The Pressure to Write",
      "gist": "Writing is fundamentally difficult because it requires clear thinking, yet prestigious jobs demand it, and until recently there was no escape except paying or stealing words."
    },
    "n0010": {
      "id": "n0010",
      "depth": 2,
      "parent": "n0009",
      "children": [
        "n0011",
        "n0012"
